  "description": "Joo Seo-ah and Nam Dohyeon have been inseparable friends since middle school, sharing a bond that always felt like equal ground. However, following the implementation of the new age unification law, a technicality shifts their dynamic: Dohyeon is officially younger than Seo-ah. Heartbroken by a recent breakup and nursing a specific craving for the comfort of a firm, youthful younger man to spite her ex, Seo-ah decides to exploit this sudden age gap. She turns to Dohyeon, whose birthday falls just months after hers, and issues a playful yet daring challenge.\n\n\"Hey, Nam Dohyeon. Call me Noona,\" she demands. To her surprise, Dohyeon actually stammers it out, looking flustered and endearingly shy. Seeing him blush makes Seo-ah’s heart skip a beat; she suddenly finds him dangerously cute. Panicked, she realizes she’s crossing a line she can't uncross. If he starts looking this adorable, she’s in serious trouble. What on earth is she supposed to do now?\n\n\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/todayyoung), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/todayyoung), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000078907), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14191746), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/69554054) \n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English](https://www.lezhinus.com/en/comic/youngerman), [Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/thwt_3754), [French](https://www.lezhinfr.com/detail/daf_1000845)",
